<title>USA: Weirton Steel increases prices May 4.</title>
<headline>Weirton Steel increases prices May 4.</headline>
<dateline>WEIRTON, W.Va. 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weirton Steel Corp said Thursday it will increase the base prices of its sheet products, effective with shipments May 4.</p>
<p>The company said the increases of between two percent and three percent, or from $10 to $18 per ton, correspond to increases in sheet products (hot rolled, cold rolled, hot dipped galvanized and electro-galvanized) announced recently by other major integrated producers.</p>
</text>
